{
  "_comment": "Per vehicle id. Either an array of extra Commons search terms, or an object { search: [extra search terms], match: core model text used for matching instead of the full model (e.g. 'Panamera' instead of 'Panamera 4'), years: [from, to|null] current-generation range – candidates with a known year (title, Commons date suffix or EXIF date) outside it are rejected, candidates without a year are flagged, reject: [case-sensitive regex sources that disqualify a title, e.g. old generation codes] }.",
